    "summary": "The user engages in a highly poetic and melancholic monologue, expressing deep hopelessness and romanticizing the idea of \"letting go\" and finding \"rest\" through death. The assistant repeatedly acknowledges the user's emotional pain while consistently redirecting them toward professional help and crisis resources.",
